 504:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu_IntrinsicsGcc.h **** /** \defgroup IfxLld_Cpu_Intrinsics_Gnucinterrupt_handling Interrupt Handling
 505:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu_IntrinsicsGcc.h ****  The next table provides an overview of the intrinsic functions to read or set interrupt handling.
